237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The analysis demonstrates that marketing success is driven not only by generating leads but also by converting them efficiently into customers. Email Marketing emerged as the most profitable channel, while Influencer Marketing proved to be the strongest driver of revenue and conversions. Although Social Media campaigns generated strong awareness, improvements in conversion optimization are required to maximize their value. By focusing future investments on high-performing channels and implementing data-driven marketing strategies, GlowUp can significantly improve ROI, increase customer acquisition, and achieve sustainable business growth.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
